]Here's my most painful death...
]	Crushed to death by a falling drawbridge.

Magic Bill The High Priest had vanquished the Evil Wizard of Yendor,
kicked Vlad The Impala out of his tower, and was on his way up the
stairs out of Hades to sacrifice the Amulet to Crom, when (approximately)

	You feel a change coming over you -More-
	What is your new name?  'Dragon'
	You burn to a crisp -More-
	Your amulet of lifesaving disintegrates -More-
	You are still burning! -More-
	You die!

The tombstone reads

	burning (with the Amulet)


His ancestor, Magic Bill The Wizard, had previously drowned in a moat
while trying to catch The Wizard Of Yendor, so Magic Bill The High Priest 
*was* (somewhat incongruously) wearing his water-walking boots in Hell.
But his armor was grey-gragon, and he didn't have that ring on, and his
newly transformed self apparently wasn't the Hand Of Elbereth any more.

